==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Golem}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Alolan Golem|37}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Super Zap Cannon''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Vikavolt-GX|45}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

